{"title": "Songs for Sailors, Soldiers, and Sirens", "pageid": 12350, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Songs_for_Sailors,_Soldiers,_and_Sirens", "categories": ["Books", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Tome_X_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Book_Tome_X_Image.png/300px-Book_Tome_X_Image.png.webp, /w/images/a/a7/Book_Tome_X_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Songs for Sailors, Soldiers, and Sirens image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Book_Tome_X_Image.png/300px-Book_Tome_X_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Book_Tome_X_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Songs for Sailors, Soldiers, and Sirens</b> contains three swash-buckling songs, complete with verses and chords.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A well-worn collection of drinking songs, with lyrics and chords.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/38px-Books_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/50px-Books_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Books\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Books_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\">Books</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-d4e342b85c7d2f10END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-d342b1b1a8e9e3bbEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_TWN_Distillery_BookOfDrinkingSongs</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_TWN_Distillery_BookOfDrinkingSongs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_TWN_Distillery_BookOfDrinkingSongs\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">f567ccfe-6d6d-493c-bca3-a106b5fb4bc9</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f567ccfe-6d6d-493c-bca3-a106b5fb4bc9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f567ccfe-6d6d-493c-bca3-a106b5fb4bc9\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Waning_Moon_Inn\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Waning Moon Inn\">Waning Moon Inn</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-211&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-75</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><b>The Drunken Dwarf</b>\n</p><p><br>\n<i>Em</i>\n</p><p>The dwarf drank once, and she beat the drum\n</p><p><i>D</i>\n</p><p>The dwarf drank twice, and her lips went numb,\n</p><p><i>Em</i>\n</p><p>The dwarf drank thrice, and she smashed her thumb,\n</p><p><i>D | Em</i>\n</p><p>Hey-eye-diddle-eye-aye!\n</p><p><br>\n<i>Em</i>\n</p><p>The elf drank once, and he started moaning\n</p><p><i>D</i>\n</p><p>The elf drank twice, and his mind went roaming\n</p><p><i>Em</i>\n</p><p>The elf drank thrice, and his mouth was foaming,\n</p><p><i>D | Em</i>\n</p><p>Hey-eye-didle-eye-aye!\n</p><p><br>\n<b>Salty Dick the Sailor</b>\n</p><p><br>\n<i>C</i>\n</p><p>I met him in the <a href=\"/wiki/Elfsong_Tavern\" title=\"Elfsong Tavern\">Elfsong</a>\n</p><p><i>F | C</i>\n</p><p>He had but one black eye\n</p><p><i>F | C</i>\n</p><p>And there he slept until he wept\n</p><p><i>Gm7 | C</i>\n</p><p>And drained his vessel dry.\n</p><p><br>\n<i>C</i>\n</p><p>He bolted to attention\n</p><p><i>F | C</i>\n</p><p>I saluted him in kind\n</p><p><i>F | C</i>\n</p><p>One lucky stroke, I shared a smoke\n</p><p><i>Gm7 | C</i>\n</p><p>And paid him no more mind.\n</p><p><br>\n<b>Love Requited</b>\n</p><p><br>\n<i>Gm | Cm | Gm</i>\n</p><p>After some ales, alas and alck\n</p><p><i>Gm | D | Gm</i>\n</p><p>Your eye falls upon one who won't glance back -\n</p><p><i>D | D7 | G</i>\n</p><p>A pretty priest of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tyr\" title=\"Tyr\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Tyr_Icon.webp/17px-Tyr_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Tyr_Icon.webp/25px-Tyr_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Tyr_Icon.webp/34px-Tyr_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tyr\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Tyr_Icon.webp/17px-Tyr_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"17\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Tyr_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tyr\" title=\"Tyr\">Tyr</a>.\n</p><p><i>G | C | G</i>\n</p><p>Have heart, my friend,\n</p><p><i>C | D7 | G</i>\n</p><p>I know it too well.\n</p><p><i>Cm | Gm</i>\n</p><p>But tell them these few words,\n</p><p><i>Cm | A7♭5 | D</i>\n</p><p>It works like a spell...\n</p><p><i>Gm</i>\n</p><p>'I'm a Paladin of Sune!\n</p><p><i>Gm | Cm | Gm</i>\n</p><p>A Warrior of love!\n</p><p><i>C | Gm</i>\n</p><p>There's no better lover\n</p><p><i>Cm | A7♭5 | D</i>\n</p><p>In all the planes above!\n</p><p><i>Gm | Cm | Gm</i>\n</p><p>And my act of devotion,\n</p><p><i>C | Gm</i>\n</p><p>My vow to my goddess:\n</p><p><i>D | D7 | G</i>\n</p><p>Both of us, in motion.'\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715042940\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1486/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32204/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12558/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 928361/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.346      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   38.346      1 -total\n 50.80%   19.479      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.70%   17.139     15 Template:Trim\n 24.10%    9.242      2 Template:Uid\n 16.96%    6.503      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.33%    5.494      2 Template:Icon_link\n 13.97%    5.358      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.43%    3.998      1 Template:Books\n  9.25%    3.549      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12350-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715042940 and revision id 337512. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}